Liberation Sans fonts for the browser build
===========================================

crates/model/fonts/LiberationSans-{Regular,Bold,Italic,BoldItalic}.ttf are the
unmodified files from Liberation Fonts 2.1.5:
https://github.com/liberationfonts/liberation-fonts/releases/tag/2.1.5
(liberation-fonts-ttf-2.1.5.tar.gz, SHA-256
7191c669bf38899f73a2094ed00f7b800553364f90e2637010a69c0e268f25d0)

Digitized data copyright (c) 2010 Google Corporation
	with Reserved Font Arimo, Tinos and Cousine.
Copyright (c) 2012 Red Hat, Inc.
	with Reserved Font Name Liberation.
Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1; see LICENSE in this
directory.

Only the wasm32 build embeds them, because a browser has no system fonts.
Liberation Sans has Arial's metrics, so the font database also lists its faces
under the family name Arial; the font files themselves are not changed.
